This is an experimental port of Physical Taby for the
Waveshare ESP32-C6-Touch-LCD-1.47 and -M (pin-header) variant.

Taby firmware and animation artwork originate from
https://github.com/TRIIIS-LABS/firmware-taby
The repository-root LICENSE and firmware/NOTICE continue to apply, including
the separate restrictions on Taby artwork. Converted animations are derived
from that artwork and retain its license. This port does not rebrand Taby.

The esp_lcd_jd9853 component was copied from Waveshare's official examples:
https://files.waveshare.com/wiki/ESP32-C6-Touch-LCD-1.47/ESP32-C6-Touch-LCD-1.47-Demo.zip
ESP-IDF/03_lvgl_example/components/esp_lcd_jd9853
Retrieved 2026-11-17. The source and header carry:
Copyright 2022-2023 Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD; Apache-2.0.
Original notices are preserved. The port propagates the driver's color-transfer
error instead of ignoring it. The new board adapter uses Waveshare's published
pin assignments, panel offsets, inversion and AXS5106 register layout.

The expanded target links LVGL 8.3.11 (MIT, Copyright 2021 LVGL Kft) and
Espressif mDNS 1.10.1 (Apache-2.0) from the ESP component registry, pinned in
dependencies.lock. Binary bundles include their license documents alongside
the ESP-IDF 5.5.2 component notices. The reduced reusable icons derive from
the original repository's Lucide icon assets; firmware/NOTICE applies.
